Proof protocol:
echo "ephemeral-should-die" | sudo tee /root/SCRATCH
echo "persist-me" | sudo tee /persist/PROOF
sudo reboot
# after boot:
cat /root/SCRATCH     # should fail
cat /persist/PROOF    # should work
ssh lab true          # should still work if keys persisted
Capture both outcomes in notes. A proof that only tests the success path is incomplete.

